            <span>
                <strong>Post-Treatment Payment (Placeholder):</strong> For paying post-treatment balances online (Razorpay / Cashfree / Pine Labs / PayU integration planned; not for appointment booking). Please contact +91 73044 32681.
            </span>
            <button type="button" id="closeTopPaymentNotice" class="text-brand-gold font-bold px-2 cursor-pointer">✕</button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Navigation Bar (Server /logo.svg + Full Uncut Clinic Name) -->
    <header class="sticky top-0 z-40 bg-brand-offwhite/95 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-brand-border shadow-sm w-full">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-3 sm:px-6 min-h-18 sm:min-h-20 py-2 flex items-center justify-between gap-2 sm:gap-4">

