                        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-brand-grey-text mt-3 leading-relaxed border-t border-brand-border pt-3">
                            Comfort is a core focus of endodontic care at our clinic using modern anesthesia and rotary instrumentation. Individual comfort, visit count, and crown or restoration needs depend on the tooth's condition and clinical assessment.
